title: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 3 of 5, 'Clinical documentation')
intro: Step 3 is one page: a drop zone and one checklist card with a clinical summary and a document list. The required documents come from the payer's saved list for the level of care (Payers › Documents). What a request of this type usually carries is added and labelled 'Typical for ...', never as a payer's rule. Nothing here blocks: what is missing is listed again, with a fix, on Review & submit.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Continue to Clinical documentation' on Eligibility & Benefits\nOr click step 3 in the stepper"
start s2 "Click 'Continue' on a case in Case Manager\nwhose agents have not started"
screen sc "Clinical documentation\n'Drop what you have. Reader sorts the files and lists what is still missing. The required items come from the payer's saved list.'\nHeader button 'Use sample chart'"

group gPage "The page"
  screen dz "Drop zone\n'Drop everything you have for this patient'\nPrivacy mode note and 'Pull a chart from EMR Connect'"
  screen pr "Progress line\n'3 of 4 ready' with a bar and '1 to go'\nPill 'Required documents are in' when no required one is missing"
  screen gc "Clinical summary\n'Diagnoses (ICD-10)' (Recommended), 'Reason for the request' (Recommended)"
  screen gd "Documents\n'Summit asks for 9 documents for Residential 3.5. 7 are required.'\nRequired first, then recommended, then typical for the type, then any file not on the list"
  process pPay "A case Payers redrafted after a payer change shows one line\n'Updated for a payer change on 10/20'"
  screen ft "Footer bar, always in view\n'Back', 'Save as draft', 'Continue' and a hint line"
endgroup

goto g41 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Drop files and let Reader sort them"
goto g45 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Pull a chart from EMR Connect"
goto g42 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Required and typical documents by type"
goto g43 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Clinical summary and document rows"
goto g44 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Replace a document or mark it not available"

process pCount "'N of M ready' counts the required documents and the typical ones for the type\nA document marked not available counts as ready: the person dealt with it\nRecommended documents are not counted"
process pLine "The footer and the rows read the same list, so they always agree"
decision dq "Is a required document neither added nor marked not available?"
toast tHint "Footer hint: 'Not in yet: ASAM assessment, Nursing note and 1 more. You can go on; Review & submit lists what is missing.'"
toast tReady "Hint: 'Nothing is sent to the payer until a clinician signs.'"
process pStep "The step reads Needs attention · 'N required documents to add'\nor Complete · 'N of M ready'"

group gBtn "Footer buttons"
  click cBack "Click 'Back'"
  process pBack "Back to Eligibility & Benefits\nThe draft is kept"
  click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
  click cCont "Click 'Continue'"
  decision dRan "Have the agents already started on this case?"
  process pDirect "Goes straight to step 4, Authorization preparation\nNo question is asked"
  overlay oConf "Start the agents?\nJ.M., Residential 3.5 · Summit Medicaid HMO\n'Reader swaps names, dates and IDs for codes and reads the chart. Verify, Criteria, Historian and Placement check coverage, rules and how Summit has ruled. Scribe drafts the case and may ask you a question or two.'\n'Nothing is sent to the payer until a clinician signs.'"
  click cCancel "Click 'Cancel', press Escape, or click outside"
  click cStart "Click 'Start the agents'"
endgroup
goto gSave "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Save as draft and leave"
goto gAgents "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Authorization preparation › Start the run and watch it"
goto gElig "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"

s1 --> sc
s2 --> sc
sc --> dz --> pr --> gc --> gd --> ft
sc --> pPay
dz --> g41
dz --> g45
gc --> g43
gd --> g43
gd --> g44
gd --> g42
pr --> pCount --> pLine --> dq
dq -->|Yes| tHint --> pStep
dq -->|No| tReady --> pStep
ft --> cBack --> pBack --> gElig
ft --> cSave --> gSave
ft --> cCont --> dRan
dRan -->|Yes| pDirect --> gAgents
dRan -->|No| oConf
oConf --> cCancel --> ft
oConf --> cStart --> gAgents
